# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented here. The format follows
[Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/) and the project uses
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/). Keep the `Unreleased` section at the top
(`rumbo gate G5` checks it) and move its entries under a `## [X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD` heading when
you tag a release: `.github/workflows/release.yml` publishes the tag.

